WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.775
[inaudible] like a dream.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:09.743
Let's get your chute up.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.577
I'm ready.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.978
Here we go.

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:14.047
BEAR GRYLLS: Terry Crews and I
just landed on a small airfield

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.015
in the Icelandic mountains.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.151
Last night, he told
me that skydiving

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:19.986
was on his bucket list.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.323
Well, Terry, be careful
what you wish for.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.191
I'm very nervous.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:27.861
It feel really real, wow.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.195
You're going to be like this.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.897
I'm going to fly around
this side of you, yeah.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:31.865
A nice, bug, banana.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.433
We're going to be here.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.069
We're hooked up with one of our
team who is a tandem master.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.337
We've got two chutes.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.006
I got to ask, is
unconsciousness a thing?

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.141
For sure.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.442
What would knock
you unconscious?

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.344
Jumping out of a plane
door open while it's

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.513
flying it 150 miles an hour.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.947
Yeah, it's like [inaudible].

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:50.450
Something cut you, you
hit your head on something,

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:51.951
or we crash into each other.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:53.453
We're falling at
150 mile an hour.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.654
Yeah.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.589
We're going to hook him
up, get him out his plane,

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.858
and take him to
12,000 feet, door

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.827
open, and then throw him out.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.230
Quick final checks.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.732
[inaudible] good.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:07.000
Feeling good inside.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.468
You're going to see
the look of terror.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:12.806
I believe my mother is
watching over me at all times.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.740
Trust the process.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.008
Trust yourself.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.577
OK.

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:21.181
She was always
proud of me, and I

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.016
always want to make her proud.

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:26.186
And today, I plan to
do that right now.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.053
We're all here.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.054
That's it.

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:29.622
That's it.
- No going back.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:30.523
When that door closes--

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.724
No going back.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.327
I'm going up there to be
a little closer to my mom.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.273
Whoo.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.443
Oh, we're up here.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.213
Oh.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.447
Oh, my God.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.748
BEAR GRYLLS: Look
at these clouds.

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.217
This is going to be epic.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.185
Where we at now?

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.020
BEAR GRYLLS: Not even five yet.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.322
We got to get to 12.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.094
PILOT: Approaching
the jump site now.

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:10.196
Maintaining 12,000 feet.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:13.900
Jumpers, get ready.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:14.868
Here we go.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.102
Here we go.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.036
PILOT: Open the door, guys.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:18.137
You ready?

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:21.241
BEAR GRYLLS: Here we go.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.142
There's no going back now.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.678
Let's go.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:26.813
Whoo.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.181
PILOT: You guys are good to go.
- Here we go.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.015
Oh, my God.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.350
Ready, [inaudible].

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.284
Oh.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.232
Yeah, whoa.

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.149
I love it, whoo.

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:16.095
[inaudible], Terry.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:18.932
We got him.

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:19.966
He's on the canopy.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.868
TERRY CREWS: I am doing it.

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:24.837
I am flying right now.

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:27.240
Absolutely incredible.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.409
Thank you, Bear.

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:30.810
Thank you.

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:34.948
This whole experience, man, I
mean literally, sleeping next

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:39.352
to a volcano, hanging off
the side of helicopters, man,

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:41.254
jumping out of planes.

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:42.789
[inaudible] what can I say, man?

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:43.856
This is crazy.

